<title>UK: Canal Plus prices 2.0 bln FFR exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus prices 2.0 bln FFR exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue has been priced by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CANAL PLUS</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY   *01.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    01.APR.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    IND PREM   13-16 PCT LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> SELL CONC  1.50	CONVERSION PREMIUM   15.8 PCT</p>
<p> CONVERSION PRICE     8500 ITL   *FOUR-YEAR NON-CALL</p>
<p> NOTES	EXCHANGEABLE INTO SHARES OF MEDIASET SPA</p>
<p>		18-MONTH MANDATORY CALL IF CANAL'S MERGER WITH</p>
<p>		NETHOLD IS NOT COMPLETED BY</p>
<p>		31.AUG.97</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
